  "title": "Italian Bread Bowls",
  "description": "This bread bowl recipe makes eight delicious bread bowls that are tasty vessels for your favorite soups. Use a few now and freeze the rest for later.",
  "authors": [
    "Kerri Skrudland"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-03T23:28:20-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-03-30T07:43:07-04:00",
